		"1f04c7be-783f-4304-ace6-275c23dc54de": {
			"path": "1f04c7be-783f-4304-ace6-275c23dc54de",
			"cellName": "Window.cpp",
			"cellId": "1f04c7be-783f-4304-ace6-275c23dc54de",
			"visible": true,
			"parentCellId": "7fd86439-cb6c-49dc-9542-f5b6642003b5"
		},
		"0ff4d4c3-4381-4495-be14-294cb8acee39": {
			"path": "0ff4d4c3-4381-4495-be14-294cb8acee39",
			"cellName": "include",
			"cellId": "0ff4d4c3-4381-4495-be14-294cb8acee39",
			"visible": true,
			"parentCellId": "9fe125e3-03a9-43db-9f8b-91c2636ace56"
		},
		"8480b6c3-c08e-4ef4-b4ee-a147a028c7e9": {
			"path": "8480b6c3-c08e-4ef4-b4ee-a147a028c7e9",
			"cellName": "glad",
			"cellId": "8480b6c3-c08e-4ef4-b4ee-a147a028c7e9",
			"visible": true,
			"parentCellId": "0ff4d4c3-4381-4495-be14-294cb8acee39"
		},
		"57dcf635-09f0-4ec3-ad67-322e6b5a2b1f": {
			"path": "57dcf635-09f0-4ec3-ad67-322e6b5a2b1f",
			"cellName": "gl.h",
			"cellId": "57dcf635-09f0-4ec3-ad67-322e6b5a2b1f",
			"visible": true,
			"parentCellId": "8480b6c3-c08e-4ef4-b4ee-a147a028c7e9"
		},
		"6dc8c74f-4432-4f74-a5be-d3cff0f0b185": {
			"path": "6dc8c74f-4432-4f74-a5be-d3cff0f0b185",
			"cellName": "1. Create SFML Window with Custom OpenGL Context - OpenGL.cpp:L48-56",
			"cellId": "6dc8c74f-4432-4f74-a5be-d3cff0f0b185",
			"visible": true,
			"parentCellId": "9fe9695b-cd82-4d33-b8f1-7e32ee4cc690"
		},
		"examples/opengl/OpenGL.cpp-simstep-3cec0edd-bc77-44fb-99c4-443239d1c099": {
			"path": "examples/opengl/OpenGL.cpp-simstep-3cec0edd-bc77-44fb-99c4-443239d1c099",
			"fileName": "OpenGL.cpp",
			"wiki": "The application requests a 24-bit depth buffer by creating a `sf::ContextSettings` object. It then creates an `sf::RenderWindow`, passing these settings. This tells SFML to create a window with an underlying OpenGL context that has a depth buffer, which is essential for 3D rendering.",
			"cellName": "1. Create SFML Window with Custom OpenGL Context - OpenGL.cpp:L48-56",
			"cellId": "6dc8c74f-4432-4f74-a5be-d3cff0f0b185",
			"visible": true,
			"startLine": 48,
			"endLine": 56,
			"parentCellId": "9fe9695b-cd82-4d33-b8f1-7e32ee4cc690",
			"parentPath": "examples/opengl/OpenGL.cpp"
		},
		"89013c90-0bd2-4e42-9f56-53849d9760ca": {
			"path": "89013c90-0bd2-4e42-9f56-53849d9760ca",
			"cellName": "3. Activate Window's OpenGL Context - OpenGL.cpp:L88-92",
			"cellId": "89013c90-0bd2-4e42-9f56-53849d9760ca",
			"visible": true,
			"parentCellId": "9fe9695b-cd82-4d33-b8f1-7e32ee4cc690"
		},
		"examples/opengl/OpenGL.cpp-simstep-ccbe2db4-f112-423a-8715-aa1250077b38": {
			"path": "examples/opengl/OpenGL.cpp-simstep-ccbe2db4-f112-423a-8715-aa1250077b38",
			"fileName": "OpenGL.cpp",
			"wiki": "The application calls `window.setActive(true)` to make the window's OpenGL context the current one for the calling thread. This is a mandatory step before any raw OpenGL commands can be issued.",
			"cellName": "3. Activate Window's OpenGL Context - OpenGL.cpp:L88-92",
			"cellId": "89013c90-0bd2-4e42-9f56-53849d9760ca",
			"visible": true,
			"startLine": 88,
			"endLine": 92,
			"parentCellId": "9fe9695b-cd82-4d33-b8f1-7e32ee4cc690",
			"parentPath": "examples/opengl/OpenGL.cpp"
		},
		"5ec50018-bf31-4d23-8394-45c6bfd2c8ab": {
			"path": "5ec50018-bf31-4d23-8394-45c6bfd2c8ab",
			"cellName": "5. Initialize OpenGL States - OpenGL.cpp:L100-106",
			"cellId": "5ec50018-bf31-4d23-8394-45c6bfd2c8ab",
			"visible": true,
			"parentCellId": "9fe9695b-cd82-4d33-b8f1-7e32ee4cc690"
		},
		"examples/opengl/OpenGL.cpp-simstep-d112f9d2-8b80-4172-a4a1-60bdfdde5ae0": {
			"path": "examples/opengl/OpenGL.cpp-simstep-d112f9d2-8b80-4172-a4a1-60bdfdde5ae0",
			"fileName": "OpenGL.cpp",
			"wiki": "With the context active, the application can now issue raw OpenGL commands. It enables depth testing (`glEnable(GL_DEPTH_TEST)`) and sets the clear depth value (`glClearDepth`). These are common setup steps for 3D rendering.",
			"cellName": "5. Initialize OpenGL States - OpenGL.cpp:L100-106",
			"cellId": "5ec50018-bf31-4d23-8394-45c6bfd2c8ab",
			"visible": true,
			"startLine": 100,
			"endLine": 106,
			"parentCellId": "9fe9695b-cd82-4d33-b8f1-7e32ee4cc690",
			"parentPath": "examples/opengl/OpenGL.cpp"
		},
		"988a3d1e-3ec1-46e0-a623-29836012b109": {
			"path": "988a3d1e-3ec1-46e0-a623-29836012b109",
			"cellName": "7. Clear Buffers for New Frame - OpenGL.cpp:L295-296",
			"cellId": "988a3d1e-3ec1-46e0-a623-29836012b109",
			"visible": true,
			"parentCellId": "9fe9695b-cd82-4d33-b8f1-7e32ee4cc690"
		},
		"examples/opengl/OpenGL.cpp-simstep-34707409-117b-4897-9501-e1db9fd26727": {
			"path": "examples/opengl/OpenGL.cpp-simstep-34707409-117b-4897-9501-e1db9fd26727",
			"fileName": "OpenGL.cpp",
			"wiki": "Inside the main rendering loop, the application clears the depth buffer using `glClear(GL_DEPTH_BUFFER_BIT)`. This ensures that depth information from the previous frame does not interfere with the current frame's rendering.",
			"cellName": "7. Clear Buffers for New Frame - OpenGL.cpp:L295-296",
			"cellId": "988a3d1e-3ec1-46e0-a623-29836012b109",
			"visible": true,
			"startLine": 295,
			"endLine": 296,
			"parentCellId": "9fe9695b-cd82-4d33-b8f1-7e32ee4cc690",
			"parentPath": "examples/opengl/OpenGL.cpp"
		},
		"c1a6a40c-e8dd-44e7-ae65-d8f8f41b8ffa": {
			"path": "c1a6a40c-e8dd-44e7-ae65-d8f8f41b8ffa",
			"cellName": "9. Render 3D Object with OpenGL - OpenGL.cpp:L311-319",
			"cellId": "c1a6a40c-e8dd-44e7-ae65-d8f8f41b8ffa",
			"visible": true,
			"parentCellId": "9fe9695b-cd82-4d33-b8f1-7e32ee4cc690"
		},
		"examples/opengl/OpenGL.cpp-simstep-1d15d922-6788-4295-871d-41e7524c045e": {
			"path": "examples/opengl/OpenGL.cpp-simstep-1d15d922-6788-4295-871d-41e7524c045e",
			"fileName": "OpenGL.cpp",
			"wiki": "The application sets up transformations for the 3D object using OpenGL's matrix stack (`glTranslatef`, `glRotatef`) and then issues a `glDrawArrays` call to render the cube's vertices. This demonstrates drawing custom 3D geometry.",
			"cellName": "9. Render 3D Object with OpenGL - OpenGL.cpp:L311-319",
			"cellId": "c1a6a40c-e8dd-44e7-ae65-d8f8f41b8ffa",
			"visible": true,
			"startLine": 311,
			"endLine": 319,
			"parentCellId": "9fe9695b-cd82-4d33-b8f1-7e32ee4cc690",
			"parentPath": "examples/opengl/OpenGL.cpp"
		},
		"82370d76-77d1-4e9a-902b-e36306119031": {
			"path": "82370d76-77d1-4e9a-902b-e36306119031",
			"cellName": "11. Deactivate OpenGL Context - OpenGL.cpp:L322-326",
			"cellId": "82370d76-77d1-4e9a-902b-e36306119031",
			"visible": true,
			"parentCellId": "9fe9695b-cd82-4d33-b8f1-7e32ee4cc690"
		},
		"examples/opengl/OpenGL.cpp-simstep-d1cec5d0-28bd-4655-848d-ae13b1c261e9": {
			"path": "examples/opengl/OpenGL.cpp-simstep-d1cec5d0-28bd-4655-848d-ae13b1c261e9",
			"fileName": "OpenGL.cpp",
			"wiki": "After finishing direct OpenGL calls, the application deactivates the context by calling `window.setActive(false)`. This is good practice for interoperability, allowing SFML's 2D drawing functions to work correctly without conflicting states.",
			"cellName": "11. Deactivate OpenGL Context - OpenGL.cpp:L322-326",
			"cellId": "82370d76-77d1-4e9a-902b-e36306119031",
			"visible": true,
			"startLine": 322,
			"endLine": 326,
			"parentCellId": "9fe9695b-cd82-4d33-b8f1-7e32ee4cc690",
			"parentPath": "examples/opengl/OpenGL.cpp"
		},
		"e4ede59c-9139-41d9-9394-cc04c89bce7e": {
			"path": "e4ede59c-9139-41d9-9394-cc04c89bce7e",
			"cellName": "13. Display the Final Frame - Window.cpp:L198-201",
			"cellId": "e4ede59c-9139-41d9-9394-cc04c89bce7e",
			"visible": true,
			"parentCellId": "1f04c7be-783f-4304-ace6-275c23dc54de"
		},
		"src/SFML/Window/Window.cpp-simstep-7b48a43e-8489-499b-b636-961b5776080d": {
			"path": "src/SFML/Window/Window.cpp-simstep-7b48a43e-8489-499b-b636-961b5776080d",
			"fileName": "Window.cpp",
			"wiki": "The application calls `window.display()` to swap the back buffer (where rendering occurred) with the front buffer, making the composed scene visible on the screen. The `display` method internally handles activating the context if it is not already active.",
			"cellName": "13. Display the Final Frame - Window.cpp:L198-201",
			"cellId": "e4ede59c-9139-41d9-9394-cc04c89bce7e",
			"visible": true,
			"startLine": 198,
			"endLine": 201,
			"parentCellId": "1f04c7be-783f-4304-ace6-275c23dc54de",
			"parentPath": "src/SFML/Window/Window.cpp"
		},
		"338d44ea-6e31-44c6-903c-111bf8d332f5": {
