			"description": "<ul><li>The network module provides an easy-to-use, cross-platform API for network programming, suitable for creating multiplayer games or other connected applications</li><li>- Establish client-server connections using TCP sockets (<code>sf::TcpListener</code>, <code>sf::TcpSocket</code>)</li><li>- Send and receive raw data or use <code>sf::Packet</code> to easily serialize and deserialize complex data structures</li><li>- Utilize UDP sockets (<code>sf::UdpSocket</code>) for less reliable but faster communication</li><li>- Includes higher-level classes for common protocols like HTTP and FTP</li></ul>",
